            "Build, Run, Debug and the profile and target pickers as buttons at the top of the editors (the profile and target names stay in the status bar)",
            "In VS Code's title bar, as in Jarvis's web IDE: VS Code's workbench.html is patched (with your password if VS Code is root's), and again after each VS Code update"
          ],
          "description": "Where CLion's toolbar (profile, target, Build, Run, Debug) goes."
